## I think that using NDVI_1, NDVI_2, and NDVI_3 as three separate siteCovariates, e.g.
mod2  = pcount( ~ scale(time) + wind
                ~ scale(elevation) + scale(slope) + scale(NDVI_1) + scale(NDVI_2) + scale(NDVI_3),
                mixture="P", K=30,
